/-!
# Slab set-up cost (the asymptotic half of `SlabNeed6`)

`slabCost6_all K`: eventually, on every axis,
`K · (NF d s + p + t + 1) · Ut p α + 2 ≤ cU6 P n 0 / (D + 1)`, where
`Ut p α = uC (4p) DD + ePC (4p) p α + cU (4p+1) + 20000` (inlined).
Everything is a polynomial in `X = p + t + 1` of degree `≤ 19`; we close with `budget_ev` (`e = 20`).
